sequenceDiagram
  participant App as App (TUI/GUI)
  participant S as Sniffer
  participant F as BackendFactory
  participant B as Backend
  participant D as Dissector
  participant L as Layers
  participant C as checksum
  participant E as EventBus

  App->>E: subscribe(callback)
  App->>S: start()
  S->>F: open_backend(iface)
  F-->>S: Backend (conforme o SO)
  S->>B: open()
  B-->>S: linktype
  loop enquanto ativo
    S->>B: read()
    B-->>S: raw, ts
    S->>D: dissect(raw, ts, linktype)
    D->>L: camada de enlace .parse (Ethernet, Linux SLL ou Loopback, pelo linktype)
    L-->>D: next_protocol (EtherType ou família)
    D->>L: IPv4/IPv6.parse
    L->>C: validar header (só IPv4)
    D->>L: TCP/UDP/ICMP.parse
    L->>C: validar com pseudo-header
    D-->>S: Packet
    S->>E: publish(Packet)
    E-->>App: callback(Packet)
  end
  App->>S: stop()
  S->>B: close()
